    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so the bacteria basically prep the food for the yeast? i'm also wondering about the environment—like if the temperature or the type of flour changes how they behave. does a colder environment make one of them more dominant over the other?",
      "source": "evaluator"
